                    "text": [
                      "!F:e62677fc-394a-4ec1-a28e-ef8e9bf750e3!To Europa\n@",
                      "- The journey is 1.8 \nbillion miles (2.9\nbillion km) long,  @",
                      "over 5½ years. It is\nscheduled to arrive\n2030. @",
                      "- Along the way, it \nwill have a flyby of \nMars (2025) and",
                      "Earth (2026), to get \ngravity assists to \nslingshot the  @ ",
                      "spacecraft towards \nJupiter.  @",
                      "- It will perform 49 \nflybys of Europa. With \neach flyby, the  @",
                      "spacecraft is exposed \nto radiation the\nequivalent of a few  @",
                      "million chest X-rays."
                    ],
